DOMAIN-KEYWORD,gr-sourcecdn,REJECT,extended-matching
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,dy-sourcecdn,REJECT,extended-matching
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,webcastcdn-tos,REJECT,extended-matching
